@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

skinparam state {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Order state machine (L2-032) — single source for every orders feature
[*] --> Paid : Signed payment webhook\ncreates the order (System)
Paid --> Shipped : Seller adds tracking
Paid --> Cancelled : Seller cancels or accepts buyer request,\nship deadline passes (System)
Shipped --> Delivered : Carrier reports delivery,\nor buyer confirms receipt
Delivered --> Completed : Buyer confirms receipt,\nor 3 days pass with no open problem (System),\nor administrator releases payout (L2-036)
Shipped --> Refunded : Administrator resolves problem\nin the buyer's favour
Delivered --> Refunded : Administrator resolves problem\nin the buyer's favour
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
@enduml
